    "description": "**A Detachment with this Oath of Moment cannot take Command or High Command Choices, but gains bonus Prime Advantages.**\n\n\nA Detachment with this Oath of Moment may not include any Command or High Command Choices. All other Slots in all Detachments with this Oath of Moment become Prime Slots, but the only Prime Advantage that may be selected for any Slot in this Detachment is Petty Warlord. If a Unit is unable to have Petty Warlord selected for it then it may not have a Prime Advantage selected for it. A Unit that includes any Models with the Vehicle Type may not have a Prime Advantage selected for it.",
