    "aliases": [],
    "summary": "",
    "description": "If a Model with the Flyer Sub-Type that is assigned a Drop Mission ends a Move made as part of that Mission within 3\" of a Model with this Special Rule, the Controlling Player may choose to deploy any disembarking Models onto any point on the Model with this Special Rule instead of in Base Contact with the Flyer Model they were Embarked upon.\n\n\nLikewise, if a Model with the Flyer Sub-Type that has been assigned an Extraction Mission ends a Move made as part of that Mission within 3\" of a Model with this Special Rule, then any friendly Unit that has all of its Models in base contact with the Model with this Special Rule may immediately be Embarked on the Model with the Flyer Sub-Type.",
