    "summary": "",
    "description": "When making a Return Fire Reaction for a Model with this Special Rule, any Turret Mounted Weapons are treated as Defensive Weapons regardless of their Characteristics. If the Turret Mounted Weapon on a Model with this Special Rule is already a Defensive Weapon, the Controlling Player of that Model can instead add +1 to Hit Tests made for that Weapons Fire Group when making that Reaction.",
    "source": "Legiones Astartes",
