    "summary": "The Controlling Player may choose that a Unit becomes Stupefied when it is the target of a Shooting Attack.",
    "description": "\"The Controlling Player may choose that a Unit becomes Stupefied when it is the target of a Shooting Attack.\"\n\n\nAfter a Shooting Attack that targets a Unit entirely composed of Models with this Special Rule is resolved, that Unit's Controlling Player can choose for the targeted Unit to become Stupefied.",
    "source": "Emperor's Children",
