    "summary": "Friendly Models in range may use this Model's Characteristics when recovering from a Tactical Status.",
    "description": "\"Friendly Models in range may use this Model's Characteristics when recovering from a Tactical Status.\"\n\n\nDuring the Statuses Sub-Phase, any friendly Unit that does not include a Model with the Vehicle Type, with one or mode Models within 12\" of a Model with this Special Rule, that is not itself under the effect of any Tactical Status may use the unmodified Characteristic of a Model with this Special Rule when making Checks to remove Tactical Statuses.",
    "source": "Ultramarines",
    "gameSystem": "horus-heresy-3e"
