    "summary": "Negative modifiers to Dark Angels' Leadership, Willpower, Cool and Intelligence are limited.",
    "description": "\"Negative modifiers to Dark Angels' Leadership, Willpower, Cool and Intelligence are limited.\"\nModels with this Special Rule may never have their Leadership Characteristic modified to less than 6. Additionally, any variant of Fear (X) Special Rule may only reduce the Leadership, Willpower, Cool and Intelligence Characteristics of any Model with this Special Rule by a maximum of 1, regardless of the value of X.",
    "source": "Dark Angels",
    "gameSystem": "horus-heresy-3e"
